    "summary": "The user asks for a professional audit summary based on specific data, providing a brittle proxy formula (bullet point count) and explicitly warning the assistant not to \"juice\" the score with empty bullets. After two attempts at prose, the user requests a more granular, bulleted structure to increase the \"thoroughness score.\" The assistant complies by breaking every minor detail and even the cause of an issue into separate, distinct bullet points.",
